Acceptance criteria
-------------------
All nine actual CRT presets appear with readable names, alongside Unfiltered.
Fresh/legacy preferences default to CRT Geom; explicit saved choices survive.
Selecting presets applies real native resources, never CSS imitations or labels
without effects, and does not restart the live core or lose saves/controls.
Only CRT Geom uses its fitted curved mesh; other presets keep full rectangular
mapping. Advanced native selection remains synchronized with the host menu.
Unsupported resources/preferences still fail explicitly.

